  "details": "This is a multi-part canny:\n1. Large colliders can take over your entire view when they overlap, they should be clipped, or they should have an option to be disaplyed as an outline instead of a translucent shape.\n2. outlines!! this would look better, and reduce visual clutter, it can be hard to see the avatar through the debug view when there's a lot of cooliders and physbones. so you end up having to turn the debug view on and off a lot\n3. Add an easier way to toggle the debug view, its really far down the options, and seems like it should be a feature that's just available, kinda like tooltips. you only see them, but they help you know what's interactable. maybe a button inside the settings section of the quickmenu.",
